          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{aligned}x\\prod_{i=0}^{p-1}(y+ix)&\\prod_{i,j=0}^{p-1}(z+ix+jy)\\\\&\\equiv x(y^{p}-x^{p-1}y)\\prod_{j=0}^{p-1}((z+jy)^{p}-x^{p-1}(z+jy))\\\\&\\equiv(xy^{p}-x^{p}y)\\prod_{j=0}^{p-1}(z^{p}-x^{p-1}z+jy^{p}-jx^{p-1}y)\\\\&\\equiv(xy^{p}-x^{p}y)((z^{p}-x^{p-1}z)^{p}\\\\&\\quad-(y^{p}-x^{p-1}y)^{p-1}(z^{p}-x^{p-1}z))\\\\&\\equiv(xy^{p}-x^{p}y)(z^{p^{2}}-x^{p^{2}-p}z^{p})\\\\&\\quad-x(y^{p}-x^{p-1}y)^{p}(z^{p}-x^{p-1}z)\\\\&\\equiv xy^{p}z^{p^{2}}-x^{p}yz^{p^{2}}-x^{p^{2}-p+1}y^{p}z^{p}+x^{p^{2}}yz^{p}\\\\&\\quad-xy^{p^{2}}z^{p}+x^{p^{2}-p+1}y^{p}z^{p}+x^{p}y^{p^{2}}z-x^{p^{2}}y^{p}z\\\\&\\equiv xy^{p}z^{p^{2}}+yz^{p}x^{p^{2}}+zx^{p}y^{p^{2}}\\\\&\\quad-xz^{p}y^{p^{2}}-yx^{p}z^{p^{2}}-zy^{p}x^{p^{2}},\\end{aligned} $$ ",
